  "editorial_title": "Japan’s Bulker Blueprint",
  "nutshell": [
    "- NSY dominates Japan’s active bulker fleet and retains order-",
    "- book leadership today.  (Page 1)",
    "- Capesize and Kamsarmax construction remains highly con-",
    "- centrated among established Japanese shipbuilders.(Page 1)",
    "- Handysize stands apart with broader participation across",
    "- several experienced Japanese yards .  (Page 1)",
    "- Yard pedigree and specialization continue supporting liquidi-",
    "- ty and secondhand resale values . (Page 1)",
